@api = http://localhost:4000

### 1. Login: Jashim (driver), Nusrat, Rafiq (passengers)
# @name jashim
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"jashim@teslapool.bd","password":"password123"}

###
# @name nusrat
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"nusrat@teslapool.bd","password":"password123"}

###
# @name rafiq
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"rafiq@teslapool.bd","password":"password123"}

### 2. Zones (Banani=1, Mohakhali=2, Gulshan 1=3)
GET {{api}}/zones

### 3. Estimate for Nusrat: alone 7000 paisa, shared 5600
GET {{api}}/rides/estimate?pickup=1&dest=2&seats=1
Authorization: Bearer {{nusrat.response.body.token}}

### 4. Jashim goes online
POST {{api}}/driver/online
Authorization: Bearer {{jashim.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"online":true}

### 5. Nusrat requests Banani -> Mohakhali (status REQUESTED)
# @name nusratRide
POST {{api}}/rides
Authorization: Bearer {{nusrat.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"pickup_zone_id":1,"dest_zone_id":2,"seats":1}

### 6. Jashim sees waiting requests
GET {{api}}/driver/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{jashim.response.body.token}}

### 7. Jashim accepts Nusrat -> a pool opens on Bullet
POST {{api}}/driver/requests/{{nusratRide.response.body.id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{jashim.response.body.token}}

### 8. Rafiq requests Banani -> Gulshan 1: auto-joins Bullet (status MATCHED)
# @name rafiqRide
POST {{api}}/rides
Authorization: Bearer {{rafiq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"pickup_zone_id":1,"dest_zone_id":3,"seats":1}

### 9. Jashim sees the pool: 2 passengers, seats_used 2 of 3
GET {{api}}/driver/pool
Authorization: Bearer {{jashim.response.body.token}}

### 10. Edge case: Nusrat cannot see Rafiq's ride (expect 404)
GET {{api}}/rides/{{rafiqRide.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{nusrat.response.body.token}}

### 11. Edge case: skipping a step (expect 409)
POST {{api}}/driver/pool/start
Authorization: Bearer {{jashim.response.body.token}}

### 12. Trip: arrive, start, complete
POST {{api}}/driver/pool/arrive
Authorization: Bearer {{jashim.response.body.token}}

###
POST {{api}}/driver/pool/start
Authorization: Bearer {{jashim.response.body.token}}

### 13. Fares locked: Nusrat 5600, Rafiq 6800
GET {{api}}/rides/{{nusratRide.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{nusrat.response.body.token}}

###
GET {{api}}/rides/{{rafiqRide.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{rafiq.response.body.token}}

### 14. Edge case: cancel after start (expect 409)
POST {{api}}/rides/{{nusratRide.response.body.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{nusrat.response.body.token}}

###
POST {{api}}/driver/pool/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{jashim.response.body.token}}

### 15. History
GET {{api}}/rides
Authorization: Bearer {{nusrat.response.body.token}}

###
GET {{api}}/driver/history
Authorization: Bearer {{jashim.response.body.token}}
